url: "https://github.com/anyantudre/TIGMINO-AI-Powered-House-Rental-Platform"
abstract: >-
  TIGMINO is a house-rental platform for Morocco, built with students in mind.
  Guests browse listings, book a stay, ask a chatbot (a TensorFlow/Keras intent
  classifier) quick questions and message hosts in real time over WebSockets.
  It was built with React, TypeScript, Django and Django Channels as an
  academic mini-project at ENSA Safi in 2023/2024.
